      "make": "Mercedes-Benz",
      "model": "Unimog U 1100 L",
      "series": "416",
      "variant": "two-door cab",
      "years": "",
      "description": "A two-door truck of the 416 series with the rounded cab.",
      "basis": "The game's Mammoth on a 2.90 m wheelbase with the mechanic truck's single cab and front, portal axles, coil springs and a ribbed steel bed."
    }
  },
  "itemId": 3000000002,
  "donor": "Mammoth",
  "kind": "based",
  "base": {
    "car": "Mammoth"
  },
  "gates": {
    "notes": [
      "The bed's under-plates are single-sided, so the game shows through them from below (up to 527 cm2 culled at LOD1, measured 2026-10-19).",
